{"id":76493734405781,"name":"Make an NPC!","desc":"","path":"/game/76493734405781-make-an-npc","slug":"76493734405781-make-an-npc","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/38f9b693c003b56e0257a0fea89324404232e321514f9d09a2b972d732251057.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3ed6e550b851873cde638388db137aa6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-14T16:04:34.803Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Make-an-NPC!-BACKDOOR-II-LOPEX-NPC*ER-48608","_id":"689e0912ee292b5f8bfe9363","title":"BACKDOOR II LOPEX NPC*ER","game":{"_id":"689e0912ee292b5f8bfe935b","gameId":76493734405781,"name":"Make an NPC!","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":76493734405781},"features":"Brought by you,LOPEX,Its recommended you hold the move tool to make every feature work,or the remoteevents will fail hardly.\nI would say this is a partially backdoor,because it does not fully utilize the SS,The backdoor here is only the move tool,meaning you can do rotation,move,erase\nbut you still can do so many features such as Bring,kill,and some other factors included in this script\n\nas i hate just a little this game,i will reveal one of the sources,where the moves the object,my function is here.\n\nlocal function moveobj(obj, cframe)\n\tlocal player = game:GetService(\"Players\").LocalPlayer\n\tlocal char = player.Character or player.CharacterAdded:Wait()\n\n\t-- Try to find MoveTool with timeout to prevent infinite yield\n\tlocal moveTool = char:WaitForChild(\"MoveTool\",0.001) -- waits max 5 seconds\n\tif not moveTool then\n\t\twarn(\"ACUSTIC ALERT : The thing failed,using emulation handlers.\")\n\t\tobj.CFrame = cframe\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\t-- Try to find the events with timeout\n\tlocal ownEvent = moveTool:WaitForChild(\"OwnEvent\",1)\n\tlocal moveEvent = moveTool:WaitForChild(\"MoveEvent\",1)\n\tif not ownEvent or not moveEvent then\n\t\twarn(\"Required events not found in MoveTool,Are you acustic or did you forget the right game?\")\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\t-- Fire the events safely\n\townEvent:FireServer(obj)\n\tmoveEvent:FireServer(obj, cframe)\nend\n\n\nFEATURES\nKill (any/all)\nBring (any/others)\nDestroy map\nMelt map (intensity,how many times)\nCRAZYDUB (Some custom ss type to act you as the killer)\nBtools (W/no placing parts)\nBring npcs (unused,all)\nClean npcs (unused,all)\nControl npc (turns yourself into npc)\nMod npc (yours/unused/all || Walkspeed + JumpPower)\nAll unused npcs follow target (a little inconsistent,i will attempt to fix that..)\nSuggestion BBS (Its a suggestion thing found in game's files,prob used for testers,Its located on replicatedstorage.)\nAutofarm (Does exactly what you think.)\n\n\n\n-2000 RAMPAGE || OWNED BY DUBDUBDUBDUB JOIN OR ELSE","tags":["Backdoor","Hub","FE","Autofarm","Serverside"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/samir3216/C00LSCR1PTS/refs/heads/main/Closed-source/LOPEXBCKMaketheNPC.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"67d0e8e6e147e4a26e733b1b","username":"saladin3216","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/5690ca365b464d3d5943108365a84831ac8506b6c8f68c1db672f1d01a422edc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67d0e8e6e147e4a26e733b1b-1753361548095.png"},"status":"offline","id":"67d0e8e6e147e4a26e733b1b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/5690ca365b464d3d5943108365a84831ac8506b6c8f68c1db672f1d01a422edc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67d0e8e6e147e4a26e733b1b-1753361548095.png"}},"verified":false,"views":17822,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":true,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/723e52